# Output files accidentally named after a CLI flag. A shell loop that fails to
# word-split its arguments passes the whole flag string as the output path, so
# the redactor writes a file literally called "--dry-run --aggressive". Nothing
# legitimate in this repository starts with a dash.
/--*

